column2:
**Stock prices over 6 days: [100, 180, 260, 310, 40, 535]. You can buy and sell multiple times (must sell before next buy). Using greedy approach of capturing every upward price movement, what's maximum profit?**

```python
def max_profit(prices):
    profit = 0
    for i in range(1, len(prices)):
        if prices[i] > prices[i-1]:
            profit += prices[i] - prices[i-1]
    return profit
```
